Author: Angus H. Wright [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Angus H. Wright <awright@astro.rub.de>
Description: Provides reusable helpers for data input and output, weighted
    statistics, scientific plotting, coordinate transformations, and
    astronomy-oriented analysis. The functions are intended to make common
    analysis workflows concise and consistent.
